The '''Cerberus Kids''' (ケルベローズ, ''Keruberōzu'', '''Cerbellows''') are an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Those Guys]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. They were added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

