'''Aku Realms''': [[Thailand (Aku Realm)|Thailand/Kumamoto]]<br>
'''UL''': [[Breakwater Blood Feud|Sub-chapter 40 - Breakwater Blood Feud]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Euler Archipelago|Sub-chapter 15 - Euler Archipelago]]
|money drop = 66¢ - 260¢
}}

==Enemy==
Like [[Those Guys]], their main purpose is to get in the way, as they have low base stats but are usually spawned en masse. They have a 30% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] units they hit for 4 seconds, which can be a problem, as they can prevent powerful units from shaking them off (them and other, more damaging enemies) once reached. If frozen, even tanky cats such as [[Dioramos (Uber Rare Cat)|Dioramos]] may end up taking a knockback when reached despite their health.

==Strategy==
Treat them like a more annoying version of Those Guys - a simple peon that almost any attacker can defeat. Despite their high damage, the actual hazard they have is their 4-second freeze, though with their measly 120 range and Single Attack it shouldn't matter too much. If you are worried about it, use [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|Cats with Freeze Immunity]], but even that is rarely if ever necessary.

As with most peons, [[Wave Attack|Waves]] are the best way to obliterate swarms of them. [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]]/[[:Category:Explosion Enemies|Explosion]] cats can also exploit Cerberus Kids' low range to generate their special attacks.

